<title>USA: U.S. to sell $10 bln of 10-yr notes Oct 8.</title>
<headline>U.S. to sell $10 bln of 10-yr notes Oct 8.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The US Treasury Department said on Wednesday that it will sell $10 billion of 10-year notes on October 8 to refund $7.614 billion of securities maturing October 15 and to raise $2.375 billion of new cash.</p>
<p>The notes will be issued October 15 and mature October 15, 2006. Interest payment dates will be April 15 and October 15.</p>
<p>The CUSIP number for the 10-year notes will be 912827Z62.</p>
</text>
